    { q: 'How do I stay motivated to study when I do not feel like it?', a: 'Do not wait to feel like it. Shrink the first step until it is almost trivial, start a short timed block, and let momentum build. Rely on routines and visible progress rather than waiting for motivation to appear.' },
    { q: 'Why do I lose motivation to study?', a: 'Often because the goal is distant, the task is vague, or progress is invisible. Breaking work into clear steps, connecting it to reasons you care about, and seeing progress all help motivation last.' },
